From d9fd1db77b7430e7b82c1f27cac3a4ece9e472b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mabn <github@mabn.pl>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 22:38:30 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [barreplay] P8: weapon vectors computed by the workers while
 the weapon loop runs behind them (toggle2 0x200000)

Every unit's vectors are made ready (computed by whoever gets there first)
before its weapons update, and before anything in the loop changes or reads
another unit's: damage, kills, stuns, team changes, moves and turns, Lua
writes (all units), Lua's weapon reads, interceptable projectiles (all), a
beam's shield hit. From 2048 units.
